        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YcJpdtsRzo6rdux6DAAlN9oAgtb\"><em><strong>The average prices per kilometre of clothing imported into the European Union from six different countries in 1993 and 2003 are shown in the bar chart below.</strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dj98dvROnoGshxxXpd5liaVngue\"><em><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Average prices of clothing imports: 1993 vs 2003</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CLFOdaXQXo81HuxXYt4lD4hSgmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BcAqdmlrvo9YfQxQ8txlkhjdgtd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i <em>Average prices of clothing imports: 1993 vs 2003</em> y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về gi&aacute; trung b&igrave;nh mỗi kilomet quần &aacute;o nhập khẩu v&agrave;o Li&ecirc;n minh Ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u từ s&aacute;u quốc gia kh&aacute;c nhau v&agrave;o hai năm: 1993 v&agrave; 2003.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-O3LtdQTfLo1VDvxozLglWV05gXe\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IRiCdhn6DoEFZYxcYWalJ3Kbgvb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề <em>Average prices of clothing imports: 1993 vs 2003</em> với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: gi&aacute; trung b&igrave;nh mỗi kilomet quần &aacute;o nhập khẩu - Li&ecirc;n minh Ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u - s&aacute;u quốc gia - hai năm: 1993 v&agrave; 2003.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VUCbdIJLNoa83HxibjUl3jeugxc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FMfZdZ3hhoHVmbxF3jDlUvmdgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>gi&aacute; quần &aacute;o từ Argentina, Brazil v&agrave; Japan giảm hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đổi trong giai đoạn n&agrave;y, trong khi gi&aacute; từ China, India v&agrave; Bangladesh c&oacute; xu hướng tăng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AxdQdjWOootDHvxmAShlH0fdg7f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Argentina c&oacute; gi&aacute; cao nhất trong suốt giai đoạn, c&ograve;n Bangladesh lu&ocirc;n ghi nhận mức gi&aacute; thấp nhất.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Oo2UdJWyfogutexlC8Dlib9Vgae\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Argentina, Brazil v&agrave; Japan</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LIordh8JDosEIYx1KpdlG6Bhgwe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GQP3dbhx6owmoJxKB19lMfSYgUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1993</strong> <em>(Argentina c&oacute; gi&aacute; cao nhất l&agrave; &pound;28, cao hơn Brazil với &pound;5 v&agrave; gần gấp đ&ocirc;i Japan với &pound;15)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IRqtdjaUboCzZ9xO94floozUgWe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Argentina </strong><em>(giảm nhẹ xuống &pound;26 v&agrave;o năm 2003).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SwTMdgvHaoTB5Ux9wuAltoUYg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Brazil v&agrave; Japan </strong><em>(Brazil giữ nguy&ecirc;n ở mức &pound;23, c&ograve;n Japan giảm nhẹ &pound;2, xuống c&ograve;n &pound;13 v&agrave;o cuối giai đoạn)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BQRsdAy1tor0z6xpumhlnvFNgeg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> China, India v&agrave; Bangladesh</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fvhed7nhSoM7J9xQ4K2lNdClgth\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1993 </strong><em>(China c&oacute; gi&aacute; &pound;10, theo sau l&agrave; India với &pound;7, v&agrave; Bangladesh c&oacute; gi&aacute; thấp nhất chỉ &pound;3)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0tndI50koRSBPxoNTblbN7igCh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của China </strong><em>(tăng mạnh nhất, đạt &pound;17 v&agrave;o năm 2003, tương đương mức tăng trưởng &pound;7)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L7K2djZ6roIiLXxBX27lEgK8gbe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của India v&agrave; Bangladesh</strong><em> (India tăng l&ecirc;n &pound;12, Bangladesh tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i l&ecirc;n &pound;6 v&agrave;o năm 2003, nhưng vẫn l&agrave; nguồn nhập khẩu rẻ nhất)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YcKgd2ZQhoZ6q3xBXhJl7Hbvg2e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ULeBdpxNfowzy4xT48xldjB9gjb\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>gi&aacute; quần &aacute;o nhập khẩu\"</strong>, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể sử dụng c&aacute;c c&aacute;ch diễn đạt sau để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PEYfdxwruonWE6xkitJlrRsWgif\" data-list=\"bullet\">the average prices for clothing from <strong>[country]</strong></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IIRxdZGqHopBxaxpIwpl67tkgpf\" data-list=\"bullet\">clothing from <strong>[country]</strong> cost <strong>[price]</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nn2Udq05AoSDbQxU5omlCJnOgAf\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UHlhd4sxeogKoFxRtKslTBMGgFg\" data-list=\"bullet\">Overall, while <strong>the average prices for clothing</strong> <strong>from Argentina</strong>, Brazil and Japan either declined or remained stable over the period.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bjr4dxe9VoVCQbxyhvblI4Q5g5f\" data-list=\"bullet\">Starting with the more expensive sources, in 1993, <strong>clothing from Argentina cost &pound;28</strong> per kilometre.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2840,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The bar chart compares the average prices per kilometre of clothing imported into the European Union from six different countries, namely Argentina, Brazil, Japan, China, India and Bangladesh, in two separate years, 1993 and 2003.</p>",
            "question_id": 36832,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2841,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MxGsdsplkobtpkx3CPJlKnQSgTd\">Overall, while the average prices for clothing from Argentina, Brazil and Japan either declined or remained stable over the period, those from China, India and Bangladesh showed an upward trend. Additionally, Argentina had the highest prices throughout the period, whereas Bangladesh consistently recorded the lowest figures.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 36832,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2842,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DZZFdEuoAoUZw5xEfmxlcxlZgBe\">Starting with the more expensive sources, in 1993, clothing from Argentina cost &pound;28 per kilometre, which was &pound;5 higher than that from Brazil and almost double Japan's figure of &pound;15. By 2003, Argentina's price had fallen slightly to &pound;26, while Brazil's remained unchanged at &pound;23. Similarly, Japan also experienced a modest decrease of &pound;2, with its figure dropping to &pound;13 at the end of the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 36832,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2843,
